Proprietary Third-Party SDKs
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The :app module depends on the following closed-source binary SDKs via Maven:
  - AMap Android 3D Map / Location / Search SDK (com.amap.api:3dmap-location-search)
  - Tencent Bugly Crash Report SDK (com.tencent.bugly:crashreport, disabled
    unless BUGLY_APPID is explicitly provided at build time)

